    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/06f0fd5cdd460f6f4c5a762a17475e84.webp?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/7b7025e8101dd70582d7a395c2f46210.poster.avif?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/7b7025e8101dd70582d7a395c2f46210.webm?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/7b7025e8101dd70582d7a395c2f46210.mp4?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeto can absorb objects from the environment and instantly take on their form. Nory, using a high-tech backpack she engineered that harnesses the powerful Vionite energy, taps into Teeto's forms to activate unique powers and abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations to solve puzzles, outsmart the shadow creatures, and discover new ways to explore the vibrant worlds together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/21cdc5fbe34a022976bf6ecea87b71e3.webp?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/6cbe4ded9a83be922daeec7258abe552.poster.avif?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/6cbe4ded9a83be922daeec7258abe552.webm?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/6cbe4ded9a83be922daeec7258abe552.mp4?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly everything in life is better when you've got some help. Teeto is no different! Partner up to tackle the world in split screen co-op! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/f5738b1c7f7bef41923d0886e0d0ccbf.webp?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/9ab5b716390babd9082f13d61a8da048.poster.avif?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/9ab5b716390babd9082f13d61a8da048.webm?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/9ab5b716390babd9082f13d61a8da048.mp4?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shadow creatures are malevolent beings that spread decay, draining the world of its color and life. Teeto and Nory must work together to defeat the shadow creatures, cleansing their corruption and restoring life to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/08a85ab757ba6fb865199521ae73a8d1.webp?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/3b6d304dbbf7b6e83667d050e3833953.poster.avif?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/3b6d304dbbf7b6e83667d050e3833953.webm?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/3b6d304dbbf7b6e83667d050e3833953.mp4?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeto wasn\u2019t Nory\u2019s first experiment. One of them was named Michael. But Michael went and split himself into two, then four, then eight\u2014until there were way too many for any bunny to handle! Now, the Michaels are lost, scattered across the world. Find them, rescue them, bring them home! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/07f8519655f550021b2a9b839026911e.webp?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/5f07836d069e0867fb230a0049ae7dc9.poster.avif?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/5f07836d069e0867fb230a0049ae7dc9.webm?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/5f07836d069e0867fb230a0049ae7dc9.mp4?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you'll encounter a cast of wild and quirky characters, each with their own eccentric personalities and... problems. Lend them a hand, and they might just return the favor with useful items, hidden secrets, or unexpected abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/bacdbf4a3e3f0e3041db1d8d9380ab91.webp?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/09dc2ad1ea0db04ceee83e5ef9795260.poster.avif?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/09dc2ad1ea0db04ceee83e5ef9795260.webm?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/09dc2ad1ea0db04ceee83e5ef9795260.mp4?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeto can unlock a variety of fun and stylish costumes, from the effortlessly cool to the absolutely ridiculous. Saving the world is important - but who says you can\u2019t look fashionable while doing it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/06f0fd5cdd460f6f4c5a762a17475e84.webp?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/7b7025e8101dd70582d7a395c2f46210.poster.avif?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/7b7025e8101dd70582d7a395c2f46210.webm?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/7b7025e8101dd70582d7a395c2f46210.mp4?t=1755044212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teeto can absorb objects from the environment and instantly take on their form. Nory, using a high-tech backpack she engineered that harnesses the powerful Vionite energy, taps into Teeto's forms to activate unique powers and abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations to solve puzzles, outsmart the shadow creatures, and discover new ways to explore the vibrant worlds together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/21cdc5fbe34a022976bf6ecea87b71e3.webp?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/6cbe4ded9a83be922daeec7258abe552.poster.avif?t=1755044212\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/